{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.ZMod.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Module.Submodule.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Quotient.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.LinearCombination"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.cls_eq_zero_of_cohomologous_neg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.cls_eq_zero_of_cohomologous_neg","kind":"theorem","line":140,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/ObstructionH2.lean#L140-L145","doc":"**The payoff, unconditionally.**  A cocycle cohomologous to its own negation has\ntrivial class — so a self-dual representation lies in the trivial obstruction class, and\nevery non-trivial class is barred from self-duality.  No hypotheses. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.obs_congr_holds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.obs_congr_holds","kind":"theorem","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/ObstructionH2.lean#L137-L138","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.obs_dual_holds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.obs_dual_holds","kind":"theorem","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/ObstructionH2.lean#L132-L135","doc":"**`obs_dual` and `obs_congr` both hold, for real, in this model.**  `dual` is negation\nof the cocycle (that is `cocycle_dual`), `obs` is the H² class, and `Iso` is being\ncohomologous. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.Cohomologous","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.Cohomologous","kind":"def","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/ObstructionH2.lean#L129-L130","doc":"Cohomologous cocycles. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.eq_zero_of_eq_neg_module","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.eq_zero_of_eq_neg_module","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/ObstructionH2.lean#L119-L127","doc":"`x = -x` forces `x = 0` in ANY `ZMod 3`-module — not just `ZMod 3` itself.  Needed\nbecause `H²(M, ∂M; ℤ/3)` is `(ZMod 3)³` for L6a4, not `ZMod 3`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.cls_neg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.cls_neg","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/ObstructionH2.lean#L115-L117","doc":"**`obs_dual` at the level of classes.**  Negating a cocycle negates its class —\nthis is what carries `cocycle_dual` (`c* = c⁻¹`) up to `obs (dual ρ) = - obs ρ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.cls_eq_of_sub_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.cls_eq_of_sub_mem","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/ObstructionH2.lean#L109-L113","doc":"Two cocycles differing by a coboundary have the same class. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.twist_mem_B2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.twist_mem_B2","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/ObstructionH2.lean#L103-L107","doc":"**Lift-independence, the H² step.**  Twisting a lift by `t` shifts its cocycle by\n`t g + t h - t (g*h)`, which is a coboundary — so the CLASS is unchanged. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.cls","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.cls","kind":"def","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/ObstructionH2.lean#L100-L101","doc":"The class of a cocycle. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.H2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.H2","kind":"def","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/ObstructionH2.lean#L95-L96","doc":"`H²(Γ; ℤ/3)` for the trivial action. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.B2_le_Z2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.B2_le_Z2","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/ObstructionH2.lean#L89-L93","doc":"Every coboundary is a cocycle. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.B2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.B2","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/ObstructionH2.lean#L77-L87","doc":"2-coboundaries for the trivial action (Mathlib `IsCoboundary₂`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.Z2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.Z2","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/ObstructionH2.lean#L64-L75","doc":"2-cocycles for the TRIVIAL action (Mathlib `IsCocycle₂` with `g • a = a`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.C2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.ObstructionH2.C2","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/ObstructionH2.lean#L62-L62","signatureChunk":0}]}